                                "sense_id": "f025fff4-67ae-3db7-92b3-7407c5319d4e",
                                "text": "Is it uncharitable to want a book that achieves so much to do more? Perhaps. Taken on its own terms, “The Human Age” is a dazzling achievement: immensely readable, lively, polymathic, audacious."
